stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Open: Create ticket
    Open --> InProgress: Begin work
    InProgress --> OnHold: Pause work
    OnHold --> InProgress: Resume work
    OnHold --> Resolved: Resolved while on hold
    InProgress --> Resolved: Issue addressed
    Open --> Resolved: Resolved directly
    Resolved --> Open: Requester reopens own ticket
    Resolved --> InProgress: Agent/admin reopens
    Resolved --> Closed: Close
    Closed --> Open: Administrator reopens
    Closed --> [*]: Remains closed
